# Exclude all generated Very_HR_Results sub-folders EXCEPT the job state dir.
# (a `Very_HR_Results/` blanket rule would block re-including children.)
Very_HR_Results/*
!Very_HR_Results/_jobs/
!Very_HR_Results/_jobs/**
# Durable results store is runtime state, not source — never commit the
# index or the (potentially large) GeoTIFF/JSON/CSV output artefacts.
Very_HR_Results/_jobs/_results/
# VHR purchase orders store — runtime state (order records + SH request bodies).
Very_HR_Results/_jobs/_orders/
# Loose job-queue records + lock + per-job output dir are runtime state, not source.
Very_HR_Results/_jobs/*.json
Very_HR_Results/_jobs/.results_index.lock
Very_HR_Results/_jobs/results/
Very_HR_Results/khalifa_1m/
